*3 [[Duche]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Yuki (Enemy)|Yuki]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.
**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.
**1 [[Takuya (Enemy)|Takuya]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An infinite stream of Doge Darks spawn 50 seconds into the stage, so if money is absolutely necessary the stage can be stalled until they spawn, but otherwise the stage can often be cleared before they even have a chance to appear and add extra pressure.

When the base is hit, Takuya will immediately rush ahead of the other slower units across the wide gap between bases, so despite his relatively high magnifications, he can be bursted down quickly by himself once he is lured. Otherwise, none of the enemies besides the Doge Darks have high attack power or even the ability to push at all, so basic meatshielding and can deal with everything even if he wasn't lured, and if he was, whatever was used to kill him should have no problems with the other enemies.

